{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-62","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-62-talk-403815452-line","text":"你遇到了一片「超验之镜」的巨大碎片，碎片下供奉着三盏烛火。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-62-talk-403815456-line","text":"「吾被囚禁在此片碎镜中已久。」镜中的揽镜人说，「信仰『纯美』…吾会回应你的祈愿。」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-62-text-6806213887617381295-choice","text":"默念你想要的。","speaker":""},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-62-text-13610392172481139705-effect","text":"获得随机奖励。","speaker":""},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-62-text-6245564956865282937-choice","text":"许愿让她从镜子里出来。","speaker":""},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-62-text-4786099974575972323-effect","text":"你并不想许愿。","speaker":""}]}
